    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyɔak ta̱th pa̱a̱ny Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu bo̱o̱th palä min di̱i̱t ni Ɛl-ya-cib rɔ jiɛc kɛnɛ dämani ni bööth palä cukɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p Thuɔk Deet täth. Cukɛ jɛ lɛy kä cukɛ thi̱eknikɛ la̱th thi̱n, cukɛ jɛ la̱t a wä nikä Cuut Kuri cu mäni Cuut Ɣä-nan-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Jɛ-ri-ko tha̱a̱ŋ kal täth, kä cu Dha-kur gat Im-ri gua̱a̱th in thieek kɛ jɛ täth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Ɣɛ̈-thɛ-naa Thok Rɛc täth. Cukɛ wääthnikɛ cuŋ, kä cukɛ thi̱eknikɛ la̱th thi̱n. Kä cukɛ do̱o̱pni kɛnɛ gääknikɛ la̱t bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ-re-moth gat U-ri-yaa gat Ɣɛ̈-kodh duɔthdɛ täth. Kä cu Mɛ-cu-lam gat Bɛ-rɛk-yaa gat Mɛ-ce-dha-bel duɔth in dɔ̱ŋ täth. Kä cu Dha-dok gat Bäna duɔth in dɔ̱ŋ täth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Tɛ-kowä tha̱a̱ŋdɛ täth, duundɛ ɣöö /ken nɛɛkiɛn tin luɔ̱thkɛ lät piny nɛɛni tin guɛckɛ kɛ lät.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-ya-da gat Pa-the-ɛ̈k kɛnɛ Mɛ-cu-lam gat Bɛ-tho-dɛ-yaa Thok ëë Wal täth. Cukɛ wääthnikɛ la̱t, kä cua thi̱eknikɛ la̱th thi̱n, kä cukɛ do̱o̱pni kɛnɛ gääknikɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ täth ɛ Mɛ-lɛ̈t-yaa raan Gib-yon kɛnɛ Ya-don raan Me-ro-noth kɛ wutni Gib-yon kɛnɛ wutni Midh-pa tëë ruackɛ ɛ ruëëc wi̱i̱ni kuec Kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ la̱t ɛ U-dhi-el gat Ɣar-ä-yaa tääth dääpä. Cu Ɣä-nɛ̈n-yaa läät liɛth yi̱i̱rä kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ täth. Cukɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm luɔc ni guäthdɛ a räth ni Pääny Raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ täth ɛ Rɛ-pa-yaa gat Ɣur rueec kuec Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-dɛ̈-yaa gat Ɣä-ru-map kui̱c in lot ni dhɔrɛ täth, kä cu Ɣɛ̈-tuc gat Ɣä-cab-nɛ-yaa kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ täth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ̈l-ki-yaa gat Ɣa-rim kɛnɛ Ɣɛ̈-cub gat Pɛ̈-ɣɛ̈th-mo-ab kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ täth kɛnɛ Cuut Buɔ̱l jurayni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cɛ̈-lum gat Ɣɛ̈-lo-ɣec rueec kuec Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ täth kɛnɛ nyieekɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣa-nun kɛnɛ ji̱ Dha-no-a Thok Lo̱o̱lä täth. Cukɛ jɛ nyɔk kɛ ta̱th, kä cua thieknikɛ kɛnɛ do̱o̱pni kɛ gääknikɛ la̱t, kä cukɛ päny mi tekɛ jua̱th tetni ti bathdɔɔr täth a räth nikä Thok Wäär.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Mɛ̈l-ki-yaa gat Re-kab rueec Beth-ɣɛ̈-ka-rɛm Thok Wäär la̱t, cuɛ thieknikɛ kɛnɛ do̱o̱pni kɛ gääknikɛ la̱t bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cɛ̈-lum gat Kɔl-ɣo-dhɛ rueec Midh-pa Thok Liɛɛl la̱t, kä cuɛ jɛ kum kä cuɛ thieknikɛ kɛnɛ do̱o̱pni kɛ gääknikɛ la̱t, kä cuɛ Pul Thay-loam min te rɛy kakä kua̱r täth a räth ni kä ko̱o̱tni tin wä kɛ naath piny Däär wec Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kui̱cdɛ cu Nɛ-ɣɛm-yaa gat Adh-buk rueec kuec kɛl wec Beth-dhuur täth a wä ni lotdä kɔ̱a̱k kunyä Dee-bid, a räth ni puul kɛnɛ dhɔr wutni tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji̱ Lii-bay tëë la̱tkɛ päny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Lii-bay kui̱c kɛl täth piny Rɛ-ɣum gat Bani, kä cu Ɣä-cɛ̈b-yaa rueec kuec kɛl wec Kiila gua̱th in guur jɛ täth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔrɛ cu tääth ni gaatmani piny Ba-way gat Ɣe-na-dad rueec kuec kɛl wec Kiila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu E-dhɛr gat Jɔ-cua rueec Midh-pa kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ min lot ni kui̱c in wä nhial a räth nikä gɔŋtɔt täth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ba-ruk gat Dhɛ̈-bay kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ täth a känɛ jɛ ni kä gɔŋtɔt a räth ni kä thi̱i̱k dhɔaar Ɛl-ya-cib bo̱o̱th palä min di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ-re-moth gat U-ri-yaa gat Ɣɛ̈-kodh ɛ la̱t a känɛ jɛ nikä thi̱i̱k dhɔaar Ɛl-ya-cib wä mäni thuɔ̱k dhɔaar Ɛl-ya-cib.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bööth palä tëë te täth pa̱a̱ny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔrɛ cu bööth palä tëë te wi̱i̱ni tin thia̱k tääth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
